  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TimescaleDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nTimescaleDB OASIS Provider — PostgreSQL-based time-series database for OASIS holons and avatars via Npgsql ADO.NET. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Bind TimescaleDB CQL authority and prepare pinned OSS native acceptance (03333c5)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Start breadth-first provider matrix, shared storage conformance and SQL family reuse (c9fb51c)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TimescaleDBOASIS",
